#~| "distribution is 'None', the tasks estimate is used as is during "
#~| "scheduling.</para><para>If distribution is 'PERT', the estimate used is "
#~| "calculated based on the entered optimistic- (O), pessimistic-(P) and "
#~| "most likely (M) estimate. The formula used for this is (O + 4 * M + P) / "
#~| "6.<para>"
#~ msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
#~ msgid ""
#~ "<para>The distribution to be used during scheduling</para><para>If "
#~ "distribution is 'None', the tasks estimate is used as is during "
#~ "scheduling.</para><para>If distribution is 'PERT', the estimate used is "
#~ "calculated based on the entered optimistic- (O), pessimistic-(P) and most "
#~ "likely (M) estimate. The formula used for this is (O + 4 * M + P) / 6.</"
#~ "para>"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "<para>De Verdelen, de bi't Planen bruukt warrt</para><para>Is as Verdelen "
#~ "»Keen« angeven, warrt de Estemeren för de Opgaav bi't Planen ahn Ännern "
#~ "bruukt.</para><para>Is de »PERT-Verdelen« angeven, warrt de bruukt "
#~ "Estemeren utreekt, de op de ingeven toversichtlich- (O), nich "
#~ "toversichtlich-(P) un wohrschienlich (M)  Estemeren opbuut. Dor warrt "
#~ "disse Formel för bruukt: (O + 4 * M + P) / 6.<para>"

